From 4266b0011469b4cc7efd436c76861f2e9f8adbc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Olli Janatuinen <olli.janatuinen@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 21:12:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] efi: Support Microsoft Hypervisor Loader

Cherry-picked combination of:
* https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/commit/6c7f54be6463565b659ab396906cffc358c9791b
* https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/commit/2d530adaeb196cdb447713a41e36b777511ee3ac
* https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/commit/b64348ea1d92817bc30d9f558df5039faf5abf73
* https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/commit/471415052971d7507c82e0bada3beb808b2bb7be
* https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/commit/1d3a6f847c395be917550d5b2326c1091f278192
* https://github.com/microsoft/CBL-Mariner-Linux-Kernel/commit/531df991cd0ae7b958fb293b8bfec1dc80c11e99
---
